<b>Shiorin</b>

00:05.760 --> 00:07.870
<i>Magical Girl Shiorin</i>!

00:08.270 --> 00:11.020
Episode 27

00:08.270 --> 00:11.020
A New Ally

00:08.870 --> 00:10.460
"A New Ally"!

00:13.030 --> 00:15.000
I'm so, so sorry...

00:13.400 --> 00:18.580
I suppose this might be a job for me, 
as the previous Demon Lord...

00:15.000 --> 00:16.780
No, it's all right.

00:20.870 --> 00:24.910
I want to introduce you to 
a new member of our team, A. Kina-san.

00:24.910 --> 00:26.290
Hey there!

00:26.960 --> 00:29.300
He's fully prepared, 
so feel free to rely on him.

00:29.460 --> 00:31.980
Then if I had another broken compact...

00:31.980 --> 00:33.380
You broke it again?!

00:33.770 --> 00:34.970
Let's make it quick.

00:35.430 --> 00:36.640
There you go.

00:36.640 --> 00:37.890
Wow!

00:37.890 --> 00:41.050
Why would someone so talented work with us...?

00:41.050 --> 00:43.740
Apparently, he went as far 
with his old job as he could,

00:43.740 --> 00:45.790
and now wants to contribute more to society.

00:45.790 --> 00:49.380
What the heck?! Was he a CEO?

00:49.900 --> 00:51.400
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 50 200 l 0 200

00:49.900 --> 00:51.400
<b>*
He
used
to be
the
Demon
Lord</b>

00:52.680 --> 00:55.760
Hey, hey, you around, Demon Lord?

00:55.760 --> 00:56.780
Mentor!

00:56.780 --> 00:59.400
Why are you dressed like that?

00:59.400 --> 01:01.950
I'm working with the magical girl now.

01:01.950 --> 01:04.080
Seriously, what are you doing?!

01:04.690 --> 01:09.090
I've actually got some 
handy information about her.

01:09.470 --> 01:11.340
Handy information?!

01:11.340 --> 01:15.840
<i>I get it! My mentor is working as a spy 
to discover the enemy's weaknesses...</i>

01:16.280 --> 01:18.470
Magical Girl Shiorin...

01:19.030 --> 01:21.260
What about her?

01:22.590 --> 01:24.600
She really values loyalty in a man.

01:24.890 --> 01:27.640
How is that handy information?!

01:27.640 --> 01:29.290
Should I not have told you?

01:29.290 --> 01:33.230
It's good to know! Thank you very much!

01:33.240 --> 01:36.990
<b>To be continued!</b>

01:33.740 --> 01:36.020
To be continued! Maybe!

01:35.240 --> 01:36.990
<b>Maybe!</b>

01:37.420 --> 01:44.100
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

01:48.960 --> 01:53.720
My Tiny Senpai

01:54.470 --> 01:56.800
<i>We've got an emergency here</i>

01:57.220 --> 01:59.580
<i>Are you paying attention, me?</i>

01:59.970 --> 02:05.810
<i>There's someone other than me 
dancing around inside of my heart</i>

02:05.810 --> 02:08.060
<i>I want to talk to her</i>

02:08.560 --> 02:11.110
<i>I want to touch her</i>

02:11.110 --> 02:16.600
<i>Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down</i>

02:17.110 --> 02:19.820
<i>What in the world am I doing?</i>

02:19.820 --> 02:22.580
<i>You're right next to me</i>

02:22.580 --> 02:28.830
<i>And this is the perfect chance...</i>

02:29.580 --> 02:30.410
<i>HONEY</i>

02:30.410 --> 02:35.120
<i>I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste</i>

02:35.120 --> 02:38.330
<i>And I don't think I can ever escape</i>

02:38.330 --> 02:40.830
<i>I may as well just sink into it</i>

02:40.830 --> 02:41.660
<i>HONEY</i>

02:41.660 --> 02:46.430
<i>It's another day in your dazzling presence</i>

02:46.650 --> 02:49.440
<i>We may never be 
on the same page with this love but</i>

02:49.440 --> 02:55.870
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

03:07.450 --> 03:11.460
#10 Even If We're Just Playing, He's My Kohai...

03:08.210 --> 03:12.010
This year is the 40th anniversary 
of our company's founding.

03:09.210 --> 03:13.830
Sunpick Ltd.
40th Anniversary
Event

03:12.010 --> 03:14.970
It was through your contributions 
that we made it this far.

03:13.830 --> 03:17.960
<b>40th Anniversary</b>

03:15.490 --> 03:16.820
Thank you!

03:18.900 --> 03:22.700
And once again, we're holding a competition 
between new hires this year!

03:20.220 --> 03:24.220
<b>New Hire Contest</b>

03:24.220 --> 03:25.930
A new hire competition?

03:26.400 --> 03:30.330
It's a intracompany competition 
for employees in their first year.

03:31.990 --> 03:35.480
When the manager was in his first year, 
his proposal won him the MVP award for that year.

03:36.180 --> 03:38.570
It went on to actually 
be produced, became a huge hit...

03:39.110 --> 03:42.200
Earning him the MVP award for that year.

03:42.200 --> 03:43.860
Isn't that amazing?

03:43.860 --> 03:46.950
I feel bad for the other rookies 
who were hired at the same time.

03:47.370 --> 03:48.540
That said...

03:49.160 --> 03:52.040
You're actually kind of amazing, huh, Manager?

03:52.040 --> 03:54.520
Well, I'm not so sure about that.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.940
Nah, I am!

03:57.500 --> 03:59.880
Here we have our theme for this year!

03:57.500 --> 04:06.720
<b>Subject:</b>

03:57.500 --> 04:06.720
<b>Meowtaro</b>

03:57.500 --> 04:06.720
<b>A new way of promoting him!</b>

04:02.160 --> 04:06.720
And for the department that 
our most promising hire works in—

04:06.720 --> 04:12.140
An opulent trip to a luxury resort 
in sunny southern Okinawa!

04:06.720 --> 04:13.640
<b>Supreme Opulence!</b>

04:06.720 --> 04:13.640
<b>Luxury Resort</b>

04:14.010 --> 04:17.270
<i>Okinawa... A luxury resort...</i>

04:17.630 --> 04:21.720
I bought a new swimsuit for the occasion.

04:22.530 --> 04:25.480
What do you think, Shinozaki-san?

04:26.720 --> 04:27.720
I...

04:28.900 --> 04:30.510
I'm gonna work hard!

04:30.510 --> 04:32.040
<i>So motivated!</i>

04:32.400 --> 04:35.700
But I'll have to handle 
my regular duties, too...

04:35.700 --> 04:37.800
I'll manage your task balance!

04:37.800 --> 04:40.170
I'll help, too, of course!

04:40.170 --> 04:41.980
So will Hayakawa-san.

04:41.980 --> 04:44.170
I guess I don't mind pitching in...

04:44.170 --> 04:47.930
Work hard to win that most promising 
hire award, Shinozaki-san!

04:48.580 --> 04:50.200
Senpai...

04:51.180 --> 04:55.640
I'll do just that! Let's all go 
to that tropical resort together!

04:55.640 --> 04:56.520
Yeah!

04:59.150 --> 05:01.570
So that's why you're so fired up.

05:01.970 --> 05:04.150
I wanna live up to their expectations!

05:04.580 --> 05:09.280
That said, I still don't have a concrete 
idea for my proposal yet...

05:09.830 --> 05:11.430
What about you, Yamagishi-kun?

05:11.430 --> 05:14.040
Not interested. Too big a pain.

05:14.040 --> 05:21.170
<b>Supreme Opulence!</b>

05:14.040 --> 05:21.170
<b>Luxury Resort</b>

05:14.870 --> 05:16.650
What about the luxury resort?

05:16.650 --> 05:18.220
Even less interested.

05:18.220 --> 05:21.170
Think about who's in PR, dude...

05:21.170 --> 05:24.620
Could you pwease help wif dis?

05:24.620 --> 05:25.550
Don't wanna.

05:25.550 --> 05:26.890
Yuri-tan.

05:26.890 --> 05:28.030
Masa-tan.

05:28.030 --> 05:29.140
Bluh...

05:29.140 --> 05:32.320
I doubt I'd enjoy it at all.

05:32.320 --> 05:33.560
I guess I'm sorry?

05:33.720 --> 05:36.640
You really hit the jackpot, 
though, Zakishino...

05:37.000 --> 05:40.880
You got a 5-star senpai with a 5-star boss to boot!

05:40.880 --> 05:43.940
Could you not treat the people in my 
department like gacha characters?

05:43.940 --> 05:48.950
<b>Employment
Agent</b>

05:43.940 --> 05:48.950
Maybe I oughta contact a job agent and 
see about trying a reset marathon...

05:48.950 --> 05:51.690
I'm telling you, it tasted amazing.

05:51.690 --> 05:52.830
Speak of the devil...

05:53.410 --> 05:54.830
There's 5-star senpai.

05:54.830 --> 05:56.780
And there's no limit!

05:56.780 --> 05:57.660
There's not?!

05:57.660 --> 05:59.190
Plus, the interior is so cute.

06:01.590 --> 06:05.020
We're both rookies and we make 
the same money, but look at the difference!

06:05.020 --> 06:06.840
Is life just pure RNG?!

06:06.840 --> 06:10.480
With a senpai like that I'd be 
willing to work Monday to Friday

06:10.480 --> 06:15.080
for nine hours a day, 
minus one hour for lunch, too!

06:15.080 --> 06:16.850
You should be able to do that anyway.

06:17.560 --> 06:20.100
Be real with me. How are 
things going, Zakishino?

06:20.790 --> 06:21.870
With what?

06:21.870 --> 06:23.230
Don't play dumb.

06:23.550 --> 06:25.480
With you and Katase-paisen!

06:25.790 --> 06:29.150
I mean, she came to check on you 
at your house...

06:29.150 --> 06:33.740
And you went on a trip 
together, right? Right? Right?

06:37.620 --> 06:40.290
Nothing... happened...

06:40.290 --> 06:45.600
Unbelievable. What, you see 
those boobs and just feel nothing?

06:45.600 --> 06:47.510
Don't talk so bluntly about boobs!

06:48.000 --> 06:49.630
I-I mean...

06:51.380 --> 06:53.930
I guess I can't say it's been 
absolutely nothing.

06:55.530 --> 06:57.640
Holy crap, the deed's already done?!

06:57.640 --> 07:00.160
Give him back! I want 
my pure-hearted Zakishino back!

07:00.160 --> 07:01.690
I'm still pure, actually!

07:04.340 --> 07:07.070
Five minutes left of lunch.

07:07.760 --> 07:11.820
Uh... you're Kurusu-san, right?

07:08.360 --> 07:11.860
m 0 0 l 140 0 l 140 75 l 0 75

07:08.360 --> 07:11.860
<b>Development Group 1
Kurusu Akari</b>

07:13.120 --> 07:15.700
That's Kurusu Akari from Development Group 1!

07:16.320 --> 07:18.180
Watch yourself, Zakishino!

07:19.080 --> 07:22.810
She was hand-picked 
as the rising star of Group 1

07:22.810 --> 07:25.340
by their charismatic, high-minded chief!

07:25.830 --> 07:30.720
She's got the hottest rep out of anyone 
who joined up the same year as us...

07:30.720 --> 07:35.970
And she's favored to win 
the most promising rookie contest!

07:35.970 --> 07:39.400
Time should be productive, not wasted...

07:40.320 --> 07:42.350
If you want to progress to the next stage.

07:42.350 --> 07:44.940
<i>That does sound high-minded!</i>

07:44.940 --> 07:48.780
You were also discussing... breasts.

07:50.430 --> 07:51.240
That's sexual harassment.

07:51.890 --> 07:53.530
<i>You're right, it is.</i>

07:54.360 --> 07:58.700
Not when it comes to Zakishino 
and Senpai. They're mutually in love.

07:58.700 --> 08:00.000
Yamagishi-kun?!

08:00.000 --> 08:02.770
The partner is... his senpai?

08:02.770 --> 08:04.540
She's abusing her authority, then?

08:04.540 --> 08:05.080
<i>Wha?!</i>

08:05.080 --> 08:06.750
Exploiting her power.

08:06.750 --> 08:08.110
Senpai isn't—

08:08.110 --> 08:11.510
Chill out, Zakishino. Leave this to me.

08:12.080 --> 08:14.010
This ain't no abuse.

08:14.010 --> 08:15.600
Because the two of them are going out!

08:15.600 --> 08:17.010
Also not true!

08:17.010 --> 08:20.810
Workplace romance... Can't understand.

08:21.480 --> 08:23.770
We don't provide matchmaking services here.

08:23.770 --> 08:29.160
Yet, according to surveys, more than a quarter 
of married couples met at work.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.280
It's totally natural.

08:35.190 --> 08:37.030
Easy, now...

08:38.310 --> 08:39.030
Kurusu.

08:41.110 --> 08:44.710
This is rare. You normally 
don't stick around in the break room.

08:41.250 --> 08:44.710
m 0 0 l 170 0 l 170 75 l 0 75

08:41.250 --> 08:44.710
<b>Development Group 1 Chief
Takatsukasa Shinobu</b>

08:44.710 --> 08:47.080
Director Takatsukasa...

08:47.910 --> 08:52.160
Waste of time... won't be able 
to get back to work right away...

08:52.160 --> 08:56.050
Don't worry about it. 
You've still got four minutes.

08:56.220 --> 08:59.180
The crucial thing is being able to 
switch your state of mind around.

08:59.180 --> 09:02.360
Mistakes and regrets will be fuel 
to carry you to the next stage.

09:02.360 --> 09:03.310
Right!

09:03.310 --> 09:07.550
She really is high-minded, 
and charismatic, that chief...

09:07.550 --> 09:09.860
S-So bright!

09:10.730 --> 09:13.820
You're Shinozaki-kun from Dev Group 2, yes?

09:13.820 --> 09:14.570
Yes.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.940
Your manager and I joined 
the company at the same time.

09:17.940 --> 09:20.580
I make it a point to keep up 
with Group 2's new hires.

09:20.580 --> 09:24.200
You and Manager? That'd mean...

09:24.870 --> 09:26.580
Isn't that amazing?

09:26.880 --> 09:29.460
I feel bad for the other rookies.

09:30.990 --> 09:32.970
<i>She's who I felt bad for!</i>

09:32.970 --> 09:33.920
Something wrong?

09:33.920 --> 09:35.470
No, nothing!

09:35.770 --> 09:37.930
Akina and I have been friendly rivals

09:37.930 --> 09:40.720
who've spurred each other on to 
greater heights, even back then.

09:41.300 --> 09:44.350
That said, he's always proven 
to be more talented...

09:44.350 --> 09:46.350
His proposal blew mine away.

09:46.390 --> 09:49.100
<b><i>Celebrating Product
Development Group 2's Major Hit</i></b>

09:47.200 --> 09:49.100
And the product that came from it was a hit—

09:49.830 --> 09:53.780
I've had my hands full 
just trying to catch up to him.

09:54.800 --> 09:58.300
But before I realized it, I had been promoted 
faster than anyone in company history.

09:58.820 --> 10:01.740
And he's stopped 
making as many obvious waves...

10:02.530 --> 10:04.370
But I still can't forget it.

10:05.030 --> 10:09.830
Those days when competing with him 
raised both of our games higher and higher...

10:10.940 --> 10:12.630
And I've realized something.

10:13.240 --> 10:15.260
I need him!

10:17.580 --> 10:19.760
I've already spoken to the president about it.

10:20.190 --> 10:22.030
I see.

10:22.030 --> 10:26.120
Well, if Kurusu-kun can win 
the most promising rookie competition,

10:26.120 --> 10:28.490
I'll consider transferring Akina-kun.

10:30.520 --> 10:35.030
If I lose the contest... 
the manager's going to get transferred?!

10:30.520 --> 10:35.030
<b>Development Group 2</b>

10:30.520 --> 10:35.030
<b>Development Group 1</b>

10:33.120 --> 10:35.030
Oh, no!

10:35.520 --> 10:37.720
Since when did he become the heroine?

10:37.720 --> 10:39.780
Cut that out! That's just gonna 
confuse me more!

10:40.360 --> 10:43.990
I thought it'd be unfair if you didn't know.

10:43.990 --> 10:48.560
Granted, we're bound to win... 
so don't feel too torn up about it.

10:48.560 --> 10:50.000
It's time, Kurusu.

10:50.000 --> 10:50.540
Right.

10:50.540 --> 10:51.880
Wait a second!

10:52.710 --> 10:54.670
You might need him,

10:54.990 --> 10:56.910
but I don't intend on handing our manager over.

10:56.910 --> 10:58.800
I'm going to win that 
most promising rookie award.

10:59.160 --> 11:01.550
That's a good look in your eye.

11:01.900 --> 11:04.300
One that's looking towards the next stage.

11:05.840 --> 11:06.930
That said...

11:06.930 --> 11:10.940
The competition... I won't lose to anyone.

11:11.520 --> 11:13.690
I'll win most promising rookie.

11:16.420 --> 11:18.190
We're taking this.

11:19.030 --> 11:21.570
And Kurusu will go on to aim 
for even greater heights.

11:27.540 --> 11:31.230
Well, that got real competitive 
all of a sudden!

11:31.230 --> 11:31.950
Yeah.

11:31.950 --> 11:33.800
Fantastic!

11:34.820 --> 11:37.710
That was fantastic, Shinozaki-kun!

11:37.710 --> 11:42.780
A heated battle between subordinates, 
on behalf of their bosses!

11:42.780 --> 11:44.470
So nice!

11:45.270 --> 11:48.110
You should fight, too, Yamagishi-kun! For me!

11:48.110 --> 11:51.230
Ishiyama-san, no one wants you, so I can't.

11:51.230 --> 11:55.610
Wow, what a turn of events 
for the rookie contest!

11:55.610 --> 11:57.130
Are you even listening?

11:57.130 --> 11:58.830
A battle over me!

11:58.830 --> 11:59.860
No, seriously...

11:59.260 --> 12:00.270
Good luck out there, Yamagishi-kun!

12:00.270 --> 12:00.910
There's no fight here.

12:00.450 --> 12:02.110
The new hire contest...

12:00.910 --> 12:01.390
Good luck!

12:01.390 --> 12:01.930
I don't need encouragement.

12:01.930 --> 12:02.350
You do!

12:02.350 --> 12:02.800
No!

12:02.630 --> 12:04.500
<i>I can't lose, no matter what!</i>

12:02.800 --> 12:03.500
Good luck!

12:03.500 --> 12:04.570
No lo necesito.

12:05.370 --> 12:07.620
<b>Product Development</b>

12:05.370 --> 12:07.620
<b>Group 2</b>

12:07.620 --> 12:10.000
Manager, about my project 
for the competition...

12:10.000 --> 12:11.750
Look at that!

12:12.030 --> 12:13.960
That tea stalk is standing up!

12:13.960 --> 12:16.960
I bet that's a good sign for something!

12:16.960 --> 12:20.920
I hope so. Having green tea 
every once in a while is nice, too.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.220
Sure is!

12:22.220 --> 12:23.970
<i>So carefree...</i>

12:25.060 --> 12:28.100
<i>My Tiny Senpai</i>.

12:30.920 --> 12:33.660
I hope you'll play with me a whole lot!

12:33.660 --> 12:34.950
Okay!

12:35.980 --> 12:38.230
Aozora Preschool

12:40.230 --> 12:42.170
So many toys!

12:40.230 --> 12:42.330
I know this!

12:41.490 --> 12:42.740
They're cute.

12:42.740 --> 12:47.660
Be sure to thank the nice people for the toys!

12:47.660 --> 12:50.490
Thank you!

12:50.490 --> 12:53.340
Would you like to accompany me to the ball?

12:53.340 --> 12:54.720
Me, too!

12:54.720 --> 12:56.250
Then let's all dance together.

12:56.520 --> 12:58.490
Onee-chan, draw Kyapicure!

12:56.860 --> 12:58.310
Nice art!

12:58.490 --> 12:59.040
Sure.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.400
I want Meowjiro!

13:00.400 --> 13:02.970
Okay, sure! I'll do my best!

13:02.970 --> 13:05.280
The kids seem really thrilled.

13:05.280 --> 13:06.060
Yeah!

13:07.350 --> 13:10.520
I didn't know we oversaw 
product tests like this.

13:10.520 --> 13:13.390
We see how they play with them, 
and make adjustments based on that.

13:13.860 --> 13:17.450
We don't get many chances for this, 
so get as much research done as you can.

13:17.990 --> 13:20.150
It might help with your contest.

13:20.150 --> 13:21.060
Right!

13:21.580 --> 13:23.150
<i>The contest, huh...</i>

13:23.840 --> 13:25.370
Did you tell Senpai?

13:26.480 --> 13:29.280
I don't want her to worry, though...

13:29.690 --> 13:33.350
<i>So I haven't told her about Manager yet.</i>

13:34.440 --> 13:35.910
<i>I have to say...</i>

13:36.470 --> 13:39.100
Hey, come over here!

13:37.860 --> 13:39.920
What should we play?

13:39.920 --> 13:41.100
Okay!

13:41.100 --> 13:42.420
<i>She's so motherly!</i>

13:43.030 --> 13:45.590
The kids are drawn to her effortlessly...

13:46.020 --> 13:47.510
Downright Madonna-like!

13:47.840 --> 13:49.510
But more than that...

13:50.280 --> 13:53.070
Welcome home, honey.

13:53.070 --> 13:54.350
<i>Wife factor...</i>

13:54.780 --> 13:55.850
<i>High!</i>

13:56.300 --> 13:57.870
Do your job.

13:57.870 --> 13:59.860
I-I know!

14:00.480 --> 14:02.670
Okay, what do you guys wanna play?

14:02.670 --> 14:03.860
Um, let me think..

14:03.860 --> 14:06.360
With this? Or maybe this?

14:03.860 --> 14:06.360
<i>He broke the ice so easily.</i>

14:06.360 --> 14:09.580
<i>That's Shinozaki-san. 
He's such a capable kohai.</i>

14:10.120 --> 14:11.870
<i>And then there's...</i>

14:12.280 --> 14:14.040
<i>how paternal he is!</i>

14:14.540 --> 14:16.750
<i>All the kids he's 
interacting with are smiling...</i>

14:16.750 --> 14:18.960
<i>It's like he's some kind of all-father!</i>

14:18.960 --> 14:21.210
<i>And more than that...</i>

14:22.660 --> 14:24.270
Welcome home, honey.

14:24.270 --> 14:25.960
<i>Husband factor...</i>

14:26.430 --> 14:27.470
<i>High!</i>

14:27.470 --> 14:30.240
Stare...

14:30.710 --> 14:32.250
Uh, well...

14:32.250 --> 14:34.260
Wh-What should we do to play?!

14:34.260 --> 14:37.480
Come on, Tomo-kun! Don't pull!

14:37.480 --> 14:40.140
You're gonna rip Meowtaro!

14:40.640 --> 14:43.040
Then, you let go, Marin!

14:43.040 --> 14:44.520
What's wrong?

14:44.520 --> 14:46.670
Let's play nice together.

14:46.670 --> 14:48.900
I've got another Meowtaro right here.

14:49.310 --> 14:51.160
I don't wanna play with some dumb doll.

14:51.560 --> 14:55.160
But she's always playing 
with them all by herself!

14:55.710 --> 14:58.640
You noticed that, huh?
Do you want to play with her?

14:58.640 --> 14:59.410
Wha...

15:00.040 --> 15:02.170
Who'd wanna play with Marin?!

15:02.670 --> 15:05.210
Did that hurt, Meowtaro?

15:05.210 --> 15:06.170
There, there...

15:06.170 --> 15:09.420
It's okay now. He's not hurt.

15:10.200 --> 15:12.180
Do you usually play alone?

15:12.180 --> 15:15.930
Yeah. My friends are the dolls.

15:15.930 --> 15:21.020
I see. But I'd like you to play 
with us, too, Marin-chan.

15:23.220 --> 15:24.940
Then, let's play house!

15:25.330 --> 15:26.940
<i>House?</i>

15:27.600 --> 15:29.440
Onii-chan, you're the daddy.

15:29.440 --> 15:31.950
<i>Shinozaki-san's the daddy...</i>

15:31.950 --> 15:34.870
And you, Onee-chan...

15:34.870 --> 15:37.080
<i>Th-The way this is going...</i>

15:37.730 --> 15:39.580
Onee-chan, you're mommy!

15:39.580 --> 15:40.970
Mommy?

15:40.970 --> 15:44.330
Yeah! He's daddy and you're mommy!

15:44.760 --> 15:48.420
Even if we're just playing... he's my kohai...

15:48.420 --> 15:52.680
No! Mommy doesn't call daddy her kohai!

15:53.440 --> 15:55.680
Th-Then...

15:57.160 --> 15:58.770
Takuma-san.

15:58.770 --> 16:00.520
Shiori-san.

16:01.390 --> 16:04.520
Yay! Daddy! Mommy!

16:06.070 --> 16:07.900
<i>It's like a vision of the future!</i>

16:07.900 --> 16:11.440
<i>No! The child is supposed to be 
the star when you play house!</i>

16:11.440 --> 16:12.900
Onee-chan...

16:13.390 --> 16:14.490
You'll be kitty!

16:15.990 --> 16:19.240
And I'll be mommy. And you're kitty!

16:19.240 --> 16:21.910
<i>I'm... a kitty?</i>

16:22.250 --> 16:26.250
<i>I guess Senpai seems like a cat to kids, too.</i>

16:26.250 --> 16:30.540
<i>A cat... I mean, that is 
a member of the family, but...</i>

16:30.540 --> 16:32.880
<i>So I'm an animal, not a human...</i>

16:32.880 --> 16:36.060
Daddy, dinner is ready!

16:37.680 --> 16:39.140
There, there.

16:39.480 --> 16:41.660
Do you want to eat, too, kitty?

16:42.710 --> 16:44.140
In that case...

16:44.850 --> 16:46.770
Sit on Daddy's lap.

16:46.770 --> 16:53.590
<i>S-S-Sit... on Daddy's lap?!</i>

16:59.410 --> 17:00.640
No!

17:00.640 --> 17:02.410
You have to sit for real!

17:02.410 --> 17:04.330
If you don't wanna do that, then lie on it.

17:04.330 --> 17:07.830
<i>Like lie down?! In his lap?!</i>

17:08.200 --> 17:10.110
<i>That'd be sexual harassment 
and abuse of authority!</i>

17:10.110 --> 17:12.880
<i>Serious charges!</i>

17:12.880 --> 17:16.430
<i>But the child is the star 
when you play house...</i>

17:16.430 --> 17:17.590
<i>I should...</i>

17:22.850 --> 17:25.240
<i>S-Senpai?!</i>

17:25.240 --> 17:27.850
There you go. Good girl.

17:27.850 --> 17:30.020
Give the kitty pats, Daddy.

17:30.610 --> 17:32.860
<i>Patting her while lying around?!</i>

17:32.860 --> 17:37.110
<i>Those are couple activities! In broad 
daylight, in front of small children?!</i>

17:37.470 --> 17:40.370
<i>But Senpai's a cat right now...</i>

17:40.370 --> 17:43.870
<i>But I'm a cat right now...</i>

17:47.590 --> 17:50.070
G-Good girl...

17:51.210 --> 17:55.280
<i>Maybe life as a cat... wouldn't be so bad.</i>

17:55.720 --> 17:58.720
Okay, your food is here, kitty.

17:58.720 --> 18:03.350
<i>Eating off the floor... 
but I'm a cat... I'm a cat.</i>

18:03.770 --> 18:07.090
<i>Senpai is crawling around on the ground...</i>

18:07.090 --> 18:09.230
Yum-meow!

18:09.520 --> 18:12.820
We're done eating, 
so let's have a picnic in the sandbox!

18:14.560 --> 18:17.840
But there's a shark inside, so be careful.

18:17.840 --> 18:19.490
A shark at a picnic?

18:20.710 --> 18:22.790
Be careful now, Mommy.

18:23.240 --> 18:24.830
I'm Mommy!

18:24.830 --> 18:27.250
R-Right! Sorry!

18:27.250 --> 18:30.250
<i>Oh, Shinozaki-san...</i>

18:34.800 --> 18:38.220
The castle I made with Daddy and Kitty...

18:38.220 --> 18:41.240
He's not a daddy, and she's not a cat!

18:41.240 --> 18:43.040
And there's no sharks, either!

18:43.040 --> 18:44.720
Sharks...?

18:44.720 --> 18:46.460
Were you watching the whole time?

18:46.880 --> 18:48.230
H-Hell no!

18:48.230 --> 18:49.980
Why would I look at Marin?

18:51.810 --> 18:52.840
Tomo-kun!

18:55.730 --> 18:56.860
Shinozaki-san!

18:57.650 --> 19:00.110
If you like a girl, be nice to her.

19:07.110 --> 19:09.950
Sorry... you still mad?

19:09.950 --> 19:10.750
I guess.

19:11.480 --> 19:15.610
I really am sorry. Let's remake it...

19:16.050 --> 19:18.260
And then can I play with you?

19:18.710 --> 19:20.490
I guess that's fine.

19:22.610 --> 19:26.130
So, when we play house, who will Tomo-kun be?

19:26.130 --> 19:27.610
Tomo-kun is...

19:28.140 --> 19:29.100
The shark.

19:29.100 --> 19:30.310
The shark?!

19:30.310 --> 19:34.150
He's mean, so he has to be 
the shark that I hate.

19:34.150 --> 19:38.400
Sh-Shark... the one she hates...

19:41.650 --> 19:42.910
Bye-bye!

19:42.910 --> 19:44.040
Thank you!

19:44.040 --> 19:45.790
Come again!

19:45.790 --> 19:47.480
Bye-bye!

19:47.480 --> 19:48.910
See you next time!

19:49.780 --> 19:53.180
Well, they were an energetic bunch!

19:53.180 --> 19:54.670
They were...

19:55.200 --> 19:58.620
I don't think I wanna draw 
Kyapicure for a while.

20:00.320 --> 20:02.720
You did draw a lot!

20:02.720 --> 20:04.430
You're a star artist!

20:06.680 --> 20:08.430
What did you think, Shinozaki-san?

20:08.890 --> 20:12.190
Will today be useful for your proposal?

20:12.190 --> 20:14.090
I think so.

20:14.090 --> 20:17.480
It's kind of vague, but I'm starting 
to get a vision for what I want.

20:17.480 --> 20:20.070
I'll work hard so I can win 
most promising rookie!

20:21.270 --> 20:22.860
That's the spirit!

20:22.860 --> 20:26.830
By the way, do you think those two will be okay?

20:26.830 --> 20:28.700
You mean Marin-chan and Tomo-kun?

20:29.360 --> 20:31.960
They had made up
by the time we were leaving.

20:32.600 --> 20:34.210
I'm sure they'll be okay!

20:34.210 --> 20:36.020
I think so, too.

20:37.880 --> 20:40.590
If you like a girl, be nice to her.

20:40.590 --> 20:43.340
<i>Be nice to the girls you like...</i>

20:51.830 --> 20:56.690
<i>Shinozaki-san is always nice to me, isn't he?</i>

20:57.180 --> 21:00.440
Is the cap stuck? I can open it for you.

21:01.690 --> 21:04.950
Too hot? Let's turn the AC on.

21:06.600 --> 21:08.730
<i>So... so nice...</i>

21:08.730 --> 21:09.530
<i>So nice!</i>

21:09.700 --> 21:12.450
<b>Death By Nice</b>

21:11.300 --> 21:12.450
S-Senpai?!

21:12.910 --> 21:15.480
Are you okay, Senpai?! What's wrong?!

21:14.690 --> 21:16.910
I'm okay.

21:15.480 --> 21:17.070
Adorable.

21:17.070 --> 21:17.960
Use my handkerchief!

21:31.290 --> 21:35.170
<i>Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream</i>

21:35.170 --> 21:40.070
<i>I still can't bring myself 
to drink that bitter coffee</i>

21:40.630 --> 21:44.550
<i>So I sneakily toss in 
two pinches of a sweet secret</i>

21:44.550 --> 21:48.770
<i>And let it slowly spread throughout</i>

21:49.990 --> 21:53.730
<i>There's a local bakery 
that's only open sometimes</i>

21:53.730 --> 21:58.620
<i>Where I once had some toast that glittered</i>

21:59.280 --> 22:03.120
<i>What is it that makes it so satisfying?</i>

22:03.120 --> 22:07.290
<i>Almost like magic</i>

22:07.710 --> 22:12.370
<i>I find myself thinking about that kind of thing</i>

22:12.370 --> 22:17.980
<i>How the small things can be the most precious</i>

22:18.730 --> 22:22.770
<i>Deep inside my heart</i>

22:22.770 --> 22:27.170
<i>It's ever so bittersweet</i>

22:28.040 --> 22:32.090
<i>"Just being around you is enough"</i>

22:32.090 --> 22:36.110
<i>Becomes my mantra</i>

22:36.110 --> 22:38.400
<i>Baby like sugar</i>

22:45.510 --> 22:47.660
<i>Baby you're the sugar</i>
